1
00:00:20,816 --> 00:00:22,640
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:43,584
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:46,624
=Episode 20=

4
00:00:54,759 --> 00:00:56,320
We can go get divorced right now.

5
00:00:57,159 --> 00:00:57,719
Lulu.

6
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,119
I came back to tell you...

7
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,679
It was my fault.

8
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,959
I shouldn't have doubted you.

9
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,840
I shouldn't have ignored you.

10
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,439
And I shouldn't have left you

11
00:01:09,439 --> 00:01:10,400
when you needed me most.

12
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:12,760
It was all my fault.

13
00:01:13,879 --> 00:01:14,640
But...

14
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:19,159
Wouldn't staying married hurt you
even more?

15
00:01:22,799 --> 00:01:24,799
Divorcing you would hurt me even more.

16
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:27,040
I really love you, Lulu.

17
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,879
I love you more than anything.

18
00:01:32,079 --> 00:01:34,000
I can't imagine my life without you.

19
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:50,239
Hello, Haotian.

20
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,959
You need to take Zhao Ke
to the hospital.

21
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:52,400
I suspect...

22
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,959
I'll take her if she wants to go.

23
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:57,840
I'm already at your place.

24
00:01:58,519 --> 00:01:59,120
I'm not home.

25
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,599
Don't say anything. Listen to me.

26
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:02,599
Su Qinglan had a backup plan.

27
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,120
If anything happened to her,

28
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,560
all her assets would be placed
in a trust

29
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,599
and given to Lin Lulu
for over thirty years.

30
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:09,560
What?

31
00:02:12,159 --> 00:02:13,680
Then everything we did was for nothing.

32
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:19,560
What are you going to do now?

33
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:21,759
If I divorce her, we'll get nothing.

34
00:02:23,159 --> 00:02:23,960
No divorce,

35
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:26,560
then we can still use Lin Lulu
like an ATM.

36
00:02:28,479 --> 00:02:29,879
Thirty years? Fine.

37
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,280
We'll endure it.

38
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,960
Thirty years...

39
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,919
There has to be money in the end.

40
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:50,759
But if Zhao Ke really is Jiang Lai,

41
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,080
then we're doomed.

42
00:02:56,159 --> 00:02:56,759
Baby.

43
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,879
Have some fruit.

44
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,240
This one.

45
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:08,000
It's really good.

46
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,439
Have another.

47
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,759
I don't want any more.

48
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:14,039
(Is Jiang Lai not here?)

49
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,319
(Zhao Mai.)

50
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:25,800
(She really won't leave me alone.)

51
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:26,960
(What is she doing here?)

52
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:28,639
What are you doing here?

53
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,439
Ms. Su

54
00:03:30,439 --> 00:03:32,919
was one of the most accomplished
businesswomen in the capital.

55
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,960
She dominated the business world
for decades without a single defeat.

56
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,680
Yet in the end,

57
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,360
her oxygen tube was pulled out
by her secretary.

58
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:44,080
To leave the world in such a way

59
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,479
is truly a tragedy.

60
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:50,919
I don't have time for your performance.

61
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,479
Leave.

62
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,599
Ms. Lin.

63
00:03:55,439 --> 00:03:56,960
Have you never wondered

64
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,800
whether your mother's death

65
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,719
had something to do with Zhang Haotian?

66
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,879
You'd better have evidence
before making accusations.

67
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:06,280
Isn't the police investigating Mr. Li?

68
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:16,199
Evidence doesn't always equal the truth.

69
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,920
It may simply be tailored
to someone's expectations

70
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,720
to serve their own agenda.

71
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,720
Stop meddling.

72
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,079
Get out.

73
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,959
(That idiot Lin Lulu...)

74
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:42,360
(Even if I stay tied to her for life,)

75
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,920
(it won't stop Ke and me)

76
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,360
(from becoming a real couple.)

77
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,879
(Besides,)

78
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:47,920
(I've already fabricated)

79
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,920
(a mother-daughter relationship
between Ke and Su Qinglan.)

80
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:52,160
(With Ke's identity
as an illegitimate daughter,)

81
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:55,240
(we can still demand an inheritance
payout from the Lin family.)

82
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,399
Here, sweetheart.

83
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,639
You haven't had this yet.

84
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,480
(Jiang Lai isn't with Zhang Haotian.)

85
00:05:06,959 --> 00:05:08,399
(Where could she be?)

86
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,440
(Calling Zhao Ke)

87
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:17,450
(Zhao Mai)

88
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:26,680
(Calling Zhao Ke)
(The number you dialed is busy.)

89
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:43,759
Hello?

90
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:44,560
Jiang Lai.

91
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:45,759
Where are you?

92
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:47,480
I know how to deal with Zhang Haotian.

93
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,639
Don't worry.

94
00:05:49,279 --> 00:05:50,120
I'm fine.

95
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,279
I care about you!

96
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,800
(In call with Zhao Ke)

97
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,600
I'm asking you

98
00:05:55,759 --> 00:05:57,360
to send me your location.
I'm coming over.

99
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,600
If this were only about me,

100
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,360
maybe I'd listen to you.

101
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,360
But things are different now.

102
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:09,959
When I saw the scars on your body,

103
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:11,959
I felt the pain too.

104
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,279
Jiang Lai.

105
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,959
Send me your location!

106
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:16,319
I'm coming now!

107
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,360
Ms. Zhao.

108
00:06:28,319 --> 00:06:30,920
(Su Qinglan died at the hospital
where Chen Ping was staying.)

109
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,519
(Could it be that he and Zhang Haotian)

110
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:34,199
(planned the murder and the setup?)

111
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,840
(In call with Zhao Ke)

112
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,040
Jiang Lai.

113
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,120
Hello?

114
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:42,879
Jiang Lai, are you there?

115
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,680
Zhang Haotian isn't here. Please leave.

116
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,880
(Incoming call: Xu Fei)

117
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:53,800
Hello?

118
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,240
(Ms. Zhao,)

119
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,720
(Chen Ping was found
on West Fifth Street.)

120
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,600
Okay.

121
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,319
I'm on my way.

122
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,720
(Face the Devil)

123
00:07:06,352 --> 00:07:11,250
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

124
00:07:11,536 --> 00:07:14,950
♪I should forget you♪

125
00:07:15,032 --> 00:07:19,880
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

126
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:22,024
♪To carry on♪

127
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:27,512
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

128
00:07:27,576 --> 00:07:29,990
♪You no longer have the strength♪

129
00:07:31,504 --> 00:07:34,520
♪You want me to go there for you♪

130
00:07:36,016 --> 00:07:41,480
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

131
00:07:42,096 --> 00:07:45,480
♪Your freedom♪

132
00:07:45,536 --> 00:07:50,550
♪Has become my cage♪

133
00:07:51,104 --> 00:07:58,070
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

134
00:07:58,256 --> 00:08:03,620
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

135
00:08:04,416 --> 00:08:10,500
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

136
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:15,472
♪You told me♪

137
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:19,770
♪I would shine like a star♪

138
00:08:19,856 --> 00:08:23,600
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

139
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:27,930
♪How to live without you♪

140
00:08:28,390 --> 00:08:34,136
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

141
00:08:35,544 --> 00:08:38,640
♪So hazy and blurred♪
